WEBVTT

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.890
I'm home.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.870
What, did you catch a cold?

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.610
No.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:29.830
You're soaking wet!
Get changed right away.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:31.740
Oh, all right.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:37.360
Thank you. You're in a bit of a nice mood, Chief.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:39.580
What are you talking about?

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:43.930
Everybody has to work harder
when somebody is out!

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:44.760
I see.

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.890
Yeah, yeah. Go get changed already.

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:49.340
Okay.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:58.060
Grandma, there's this concept
of an Indian summer,

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:01.490
but lately it's been raining the whole time.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:05.950
I kind of miss the heat of the summer.

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:41.880
My First Time Nursing

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:47.510
Man, soon the girls in bathing
suits, girls in camisoles,

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:50.300
and girls in see-through
clothes will be gone...

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:53.600
The temperature changes in this
season are quite intense,

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.980
so watch your health.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.230
Roger.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:01.870
But you know, getting a cold has it upsides.

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:05.630
Like being able to eat an entire
can of peaches at once?

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:11.410
You know that saying?
"If you get a cold you can get an okay."

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:12.650
What the hell is that?

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:16.590
The real saying is "If the wind blows,
the bucket maker has good sales."

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.760
Ah...

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:23.600
Which means that sneezing is proof
of you being cursed by someone.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:24.530
Huh?

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:28.980
In order to get rid of that curse,
you need to obtain a straw doll.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:32.930
Additionally, you need long nails,
which in turn leads to a lot of

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:36.390
business for nail makers, causing
a supply shortage.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:39.680
As a result, construction of houses
becomes almost impossible,

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.780
and everybody has to live
in pit-like dwellings.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:45.570
That in turn leads to less wood being used,

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.390
and less forests being cut down.

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:50.390
Because the forests are being protected,
the CO2 levels are reduced,

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:53.580
and everybody is happy because of a
environmentally responsible lifestyle.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:11.340
<b>Then.</b>

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:18.440
She's really burning up.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:21.750
I'll take her to the hospital tomorrow.

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.150
All right.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:26.060
I can handle this by myself,

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:28.370
so could you put out some medicine?

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.580
I'll come get it right away.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.560
Sure.

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:35.460
How is she?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.560
She's got a fever,

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:40.920
but I think it's okay because
Yume-san is with her.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:41.920
I see.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.390
Chief, is this the right stuff?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.450
Yeah.

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.240
What's the matter?

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:58.880
Huh? Oh, I just never took any
medicine like this.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:00.170
Oh?

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:03.810
When I got a cold, I usually got

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:08.640
rice porridge with egg and grated apple.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.960
In our house we got pickled plums.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.700
Oh, those are good!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.440
I put it in green tea, because
they say that it'll

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:17.770
warm your body.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:24.920
For warming up, my favorite
is super hot udon.

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.920
Open up.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.680
H-Haruka-san...

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.980
K-Kana...

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:51.510
That has nothing to do with curing colds.

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:55.960
Oh! I totally forgot about
the evening issue...

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:58.850
Oh, I'll take care of it.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:01.000
I'll help too.

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:03.360
Wait.

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:07.940
I'll take care of Yuuki's route.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.600
I want to become a painter robot.

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:15.830
All right, I'm going to tear it up!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:20.110
If you work too hard,
you'll be the next to collapse.

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:26.590
No worries, I'll be fine. All right, I'm off!

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.480
<b>Then.</b>

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.090
Here you go.

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.230
Here you go.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:45.350
Here you go.

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:53.170
<b>Then.</b>

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:05.450
I'm back.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.840
Yume-san?

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.340
Yume-san!

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:16.560
Are you okay?

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.970
That's why I told you...

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.450
I want to feel refreshed.

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:33.100
After Yuuki-san, even Yume-san's sick...

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:35.500
It's okay.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.970
I'm feeling much better than before.

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.690
I can take it from here.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:44.940
I see, then I'll leave
her in your hands.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.720
I think it's fine if Yuuki told
you she can take care of it.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:52.820
But they're both sick...

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:56.160
It's good because they are both sick!

00:07:56.630 --> 00:08:00.870
The best way to cure a cold is
to sleep well and sweat a lot.

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:05.540
I guess that's true!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.330
Huh?

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.060
We've got the same fever...

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.190
Yeah.

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:21.400
Hey, Yuuki.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.430
What is it?

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:26.420
You can cure a cold by
sweating a lot, right?

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:28.700
Wha... yeah.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:32.330
Shall we sweat then? Together?

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.360
Yume...

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:39.220
Yeah.

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:45.470
Captain, it's no good!
We can't hold out any longer!

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.580
What?!

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.360
It looks like I'm close to beating it.

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:00.270
Good morning.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.670
Yuuki-san, are you okay now?

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:05.880
Thankfully yes.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:08.780
What about Yume-san?

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.610
She's exhausted and sleeping.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.530
I see, exhausted and...

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:18.230
Exhausted?

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:21.660
Oh, Yuuki's well again!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:23.070
<b>Then.</b>

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.640
Bye!

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.320
See you tomorrow.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.370
I'm home.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.080
Huh?

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:44.100
This is rare. The Chief hasn't put
her shoes in the shoe box.

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:51.190
Ch-Chief?!

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:56.830
The Chief is always full of energy and never
shows a sign of sloppy behavior,

00:09:56.830 --> 00:10:00.090
but now she's sleeping here!

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:04.130
Maybe this is actually the Chief's skin!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:10.530
Okay, okay. Ah, it's really hot today, too.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:18.250
Maybe the person inside
has gone somewhere?!

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:25.260
Or maybe the alien who was controlling
her ran into some kind of trouble?!

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:35.920
Chief! Please hang in there, Chief! Chief! Chief!

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:38.020
You're so loud.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:43.190
I'm just not feeling well. Don't shout.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:45.450
Not feeling well?

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.350
It looks like I caught a cold.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:52.420
What?! No! If the Chief can't move,
then this place is going to...

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.450
1000 Yen

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:59.180
Come on people, special sale here! It's cheap.

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:59.180
Hinata-san will sell newspapers
for 1000 Yen each.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:01.280
Here you go.

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:06.540
Haruka-san, on the other hand,
will give them out to girls for free.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:06.540
Here you go.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:09.750
Oh! It's done!

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:16.430
Sweets News

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:16.450
Yume-san will publish a sweets newspaper...

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:22.010
Here you go Yuuki, dig in.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:26.990
And Yuuki-san will probably happily eat it!

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:29.430
OH NO!

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:34.790
F-Fear not, Chief! I'll work hard to overcome
the danger looming over Earth

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:37.150
and will protect peace!

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:40.930
You know, you're the one
I'm most worried about.

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.470
Um, Chief.

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:05.090
What is it?

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:09.190
How's your fever? And your cough?

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:11.440
That'll go away if I just sleep.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:14.330
Should I make you an ice pillow?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.360
That sounds good. Please do.

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:21.220
All right!

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:35.650
H-Huh?

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:46.070
Chief, is there anything else I can do?

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.620
Oh, what about food?

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:50.750
You should eat something before
taking your medicine.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:52.460
I'm going to sleep a bit, so I'm fine.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:56.970
All right. Please call me
if you need anything!

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:11.810
No, Bunta! You have to keep quiet.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:27.820
All right, turn off the heat, put on
the lid, and wait three minutes.

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:30.500
I'm home.

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.220
Oh, Hinata-san.

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:36.790
What's up? Did Yume or Yuuki's
cold come back?

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.310
No, right now it's the Chief.

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:42.300
Oh no!

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:45.020
I wonder if she got it from us.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:49.520
What? But I got the virus from you, Yuuki.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:53.390
I'm worried. She looks pretty bad.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:14:01.180
Well, I guess we've gotta go
on our evening routes.

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:03.350
Yeah.

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:06.900
Huh?

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:14.500
B-Bye! Take care.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:53.090
Found some milk!

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:55.560
The best after a bath!

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:05.490
What's up?

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:07.070
Oh, nothing.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:11.150
I was just thinking about making
the Chief some hot milk.

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.770
Oh sorry, I drank it.

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:16.880
Oh no, it's fine.

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:23.270
It's over, there's no time left...

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:28.720
Now, tonight's little girls are...

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:29.880
Huh?

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:37.320
I'm sorry, Haruka-san. Can you turn
it down? The Chief is sleeping.

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:42.360
Huh? Ah, s-sure...

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:45.720
Chief.

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:47.490
What is it?

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:49.540
The porridge...

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:52.550
Sorry, I'll eat it later.

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:55.770
Do you want something cold?

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:57.480
Not right now.

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.790
I see.

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:02.370
Kana.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:03.820
Yes?!

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:06.610
Did everybody eat already?

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:08.720
Huh? Yes.

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:11.940
I see, then never mind.

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:16.410
Chief, should I bring you a new ice pillow?

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:21.080
Um...

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.220
Kana-san, come here for a second.

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.040
What?

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:34.160
You see, it's like the best thing for her is to be
left alone right now, or something...

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:39.230
I'm sure she knows that you mean well.

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:44.970
Oh no, everything I've been doing
was bothering the Chief!

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:48.440
No, that's not it at all!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.230
If somebody does something for you,
you kind of feel obligated to them,

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:54.160
so I think people want you to act as usual.

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:59.740
That's it. What's this thing
called? Cindere...

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:00.710
It's tsundere.

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:02.440
That's it!

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:15.990
"I picked some light reading for you.
Please read them without bursting into laughter."
-From your loving Haruka

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.040
Here you go.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:39.890
Hinata-san.

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:42.430
Don't you feel somewhat relieved

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:47.040
if something warm and fuzzy
is with you when you're sick?

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:17.520
Kana?

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.240
I'm so sorry!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:26.860
My throat feels weird.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:31.770
You lost your voice?

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:34.740
As soon as I get home.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:38.220
You have a slight fever.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:42.090
Then you have to take the morning off.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.270
Even if you say you're well...

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:55.600
Kana-chan, right now you're sick
and in pain. Just rest up, okay?

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:58.900
What are you going to do if you

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:01.250
prolong your cold because
you're running around?

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:02.640
But, Chief...

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:06.620
No buts now! Just go to bed!

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:11.280
<b>Then.</b>

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:13.930
Let's get going then.

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:51.470
Guys!

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:53.500
Ow-ow-ow...

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:55.960
What is this?

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:02.340
Guys! Wait!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:09.070
I'm healthy again! I can work
again, so please wait!

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:14.510
Guys! I'll do whatever you want,
just don't leave me here!

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:21.100
I'm begging you, don't leave me alone!

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:43.620
Chief?

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:51.800
It looks like you're getting your voice back.

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:55.400
Oh, you're right.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:57.720
Well, I'm glad.

00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:00.640
Chief, you only had one thin blanket...

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:03.550
I was just napping a bit.

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:11.010
I'm sorry. I'm always causing problems
and can't do anything right.

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:13.150
What are you talking about?

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:27.490
Kana, you've got your own role,
so I need you around.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:28.230
Huh?

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:31.130
Stay in bed all day today!

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:45.080
My role, huh?

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:57.450
Grandma, I'm merely being protected
by everybody. Is this really okay?

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:44.930
The First Person

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:32.700
Next time, The First Person.

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:36.020
It goes without saying that's me. Right, Yuuki?

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:36.540
Sure.

00:23:36.540 --> 00:23:41.100
Yeah. You know it's bad when your
first time doesn't go as planned.

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:41.750
Sure.

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:43.130
The cake didn't puff up, you know.

00:23:43.130 --> 00:23:44.940
I thought we were talking about something else.
